#: 903de090e66b4bacb4b26f18aa926565
msgid "Some recent boards, most notably those from Seriously Pro Racing (http://www.seriouslypro.com/), use MCUs with small amounts of internal flash but with much larger externally connected flash chips. These boards require extra steps to load ArduPilot firmware. Typically some kind of bootloader resides on the internal flash and then the main firmware resides on the external flash."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:145
#: e83b48f7859d48dea38d044bb26f8d69
msgid "Loading firmware using SSBL"
msgstr ""

