#: cdb459bb3ec144c4a60dcda2b4f38c33
msgid "The SPRacing series of boards come pre-installed with a proprietary bootloader on the internal flash and require the use of a second stage bootloader to load further firmware. There are a couple of options to load firmware with these boards, but whichever option you choose you will need to initially load ArduPilot using SSBL. Please follow the \"INSTALLATION\" instructions at https://github.com/spracing/ssbl in order to load SSBL onto your board. Once SSBL is loaded please follow the PX4 instructions to load ArduPilot onto the board https://github.com/spracing/ssbl#px4-installation-to-external-flash but instead of using PX4 firmware please use the arducopter.bin firmware image. A summary of the steps follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:149
#: 63e87859ee41401cbd68292cd23db6e7
msgid "Download https://github.com/spracing/ssbl/releases and install SSBL to external flash following https://github.com/spracing/ssbl#installation-to-external-flash"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:150
#: 090bd5c48a1c4678a145edb290d1383f
msgid "Download the latest ArduPilot external flash binary, for instance https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/latest/SPRacingH7/arducopter.bin"
msgstr ""

